	(text "SEIBOKU external module: 3.3 V only. Pin 1=3V3, 2=GND, 3/4=NC, 5=SCLK, 6=SDIO, 7=MOTION, 8=NCS. Use half-duplex SDIO; do not connect RGB_5V or VBAT."
